# Test/benchmark artifacts — hundreds of GB, regenerated by gzstd-gendata.sh
# and the ad-hoc test archives.  Ignored so an `git add -A` can't hash ~316 GB
# into .git.  NOT ignored on purpose: verify-restore.sh (a dev tool kept
# untracked but visible) and benchmark-results.json (small, and you may want to
# track a result set) — ignoring those would hide them rather than just keep
# them uncommitted.
gzstd-testdata/
td.tar
td.tar.zst
home/
gzstd-help.txt

